<title>USA: Dow Jones adds USFreightways to index.</title>
<headline>Dow Jones adds USFreightways to index.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dow Jones &amp; Co Inc said on Monday that it replaced Conrail in the Dow Jones Transportation Index with USFreightways Corp, effective June 3, 1997.</p>
<p>Conrail is being acquired by Norfolk Southern Corp and CSX Corp.</p>
<p>The last change in the 20 stock index was when Illinois Central Corp replaced Santa Fe Pacific Corp on September 22, 1995.</p>
